# MiuiSystemUI (system_ext/priv-app/MiuiSystemUI): AOD long press on the fingerprint area the AOSP way
# (onAodInterrupt). Format: tools/apk_smali_patch.py. See PortAodLongPress.smali.

# 1. New class: registers com.google.sensor.long_press and runs UdfpsController's AOD press flow
@ classes.dex com/android/systemui/biometrics/PortAodLongPress.smali
file PortAodLongPress.smali

# 1b. AOD tap shows the fingerprint icon for a few seconds
@ classes.dex com/android/systemui/biometrics/PortAodLongPress$Tap.smali
file PortAodLongPress$Tap.smali

# 1c. Lift to wake: android.sensor.pick_up_gesture (setting: settings.patch)
@ classes.dex com/android/systemui/biometrics/PortAodLongPress$Pickup.smali
file PortAodLongPress$Pickup.smali

